meta {
  name: 12d. Cleanup - Delete POSTGIS DataSink with confirmation
  type: http
  seq: 42
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:dataSetId/datasinks/:id?{{sagaPostgisConfirmation}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataSetId: {{sagaDataSetId}}
  id: {{sagaPostgisDataSinkId}}
}

tests {
  test("DataSink deleted", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(204);
  });
}

docs {
  **Saga step 12d** — Delete the POSTGIS DataSink and confirm the removal.

  In one transaction the backend marks the DataSink `PENDING_UNPROVISION` and deletes the OWS API. The dataset now has no active DataSink and no API; the dataset delete in step 13 removes the PostGIS table, the GeoServer workspace and the FROST project.

  **Precondition:** step 12c saved `sagaPostgisConfirmation`.

  **Expected Response:** 204 No Content.

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | POSTGIS DataSink marked `PENDING_UNPROVISION`; OWS API deleted |
  | Config Adapter | — |
  | External System | — (storage stays until the dataset delete) |
}
